<title>USA: ITT sees tender, unit split done in Sept.</title>
<headline>ITT sees tender, unit split done in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITT Corp on Wednesday said it expected to complete its proposed stock buyback and split of the company into three units by mid- to late September.</p>
<p>Chairman Rand Araskog said the company had intensified its cost-cutting program and expected as much as $15 million more in savings on top of the $20 million in cuts already announced.</p>
<p>&quot;We're not done with the cost-reduction program yet,&quot; he told analysts in a telephone conference call.</p>
</text>
